# Dialog Image Placeholder  
# This should be a 493x312 pixel bitmap (.bmp) file
# Shows on the left side of installer welcome/completion dialogs
# Should contain your company logo and professional branding
# 
# To create:
# 1. Create a 493x312 pixel image
# 2. Add your CBWSS logo
# 3. Add company branding (3DTek)
# 4. Use professional colors (blues, grays)
# 5. Save as Dialog.bmp in this folder